                "word": "meteorite",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "562f360b-1c41-43c5-b8f2-b10ab72e16e0",
                        "entry_id": "bc774bb5-2d61-3507-a994-744d69b4c2a3",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "meteorites"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4d0c44d0-85e3-351a-9bcd-f45949943cf4",
                        "entry_id": "bc774bb5-2d61-3507-a994-744d69b4c2a3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A metallic or stony object or body that is the remains of a meteoroid."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2ebe9a5e-009b-4c7f-bae4-f8f89e780088",
                                "sense_id": "4d0c44d0-85e3-351a-9bcd-f45949943cf4",
                                "text": "The Vestan, Lunar, and Martian meteorites are achondrites."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0b21c6a8-9fd6-4a11-a361-9198bf128fbc",
                                "sense_id": "4d0c44d0-85e3-351a-9bcd-f45949943cf4",
                                "text": "Approximately 1.25 miles of Virginia Highway 58 was rerouted to merge with US Highway 25E south of the gap. This photograph shows the phenomenon of the “fogfall,” when fog trapped in the meteorite crater of Middlesboro escapes […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "aa646036-34c7-48f5-84b8-739e7737ff9c",
                        "source_entry_id": "bc774bb5-2d61-3507-a994-744d69b4c2a3",
                        "source_sense_id": "4d0c44d0-85e3-351a-9bcd-f45949943cf4",
                        "source_sense_description": "remains of a meteor",
                        "target_lang_word": "meteorit",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "meteorit",
                                "target_lang_code": "cs",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "69b53747-98e7-3d19-aac0-ff6c4a967204",
                                        "entry_id": "eb119292-b0f6-3d68-8ddc-2729f6d29611",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "kovové či kamenné kosmické těleso, které proniklo až na zem"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1bd49b3b-6008-48f2-987f-bf50b012e686",
                                                "sense_id": "69b53747-98e7-3d19-aac0-ff6c4a967204",
                                                "text": "Těleso, jež jsme minuli, nebylo nic než meteorit, ovšem rozměrů ohromných, jejž přitažlivost zemská zachytila a v družici proměnila."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bd955bca-cc93-4e57-aae4-c618e1ab0e55",
                        "source_entry_id": "bc774bb5-2d61-3507-a994-744d69b4c2a3",
                        "source_sense_id": "4d0c44d0-85e3-351a-9bcd-f45949943cf4",
                        "source_sense_description": "remains of a meteor",
                        "target_lang_word": "meteoriet",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "meteoriet",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dd6ab964-7f08-340b-af29-ce0a8c0d4c97",
                                        "entry_id": "8b1b3f96-2237-377d-b138-60dd7589356e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "uit de ruimte afkomstige steen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "181c020f-4018-4cde-8506-d4673a2a9c8f",
                                                "sense_id": "dd6ab964-7f08-340b-af29-ce0a8c0d4c97",
                                                "text": "Het voorwerp dat in januari met hoge snelheid neerstortte in de Noord-Hollandse plaats Broek in Waterland blijkt een meteoriet te zijn geweest."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b8c143c1-7421-425c-bf88-b511013bd5ec",
                                                "sense_id": "dd6ab964-7f08-340b-af29-ce0a8c0d4c97",
                                                "text": "Alle bouwstenen van DNA bereikten de aarde ooit via meteorieten"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b19557f8-e8d1-41b1-ae11-335bd15b1b39",
                        "source_entry_id": "bc774bb5-2d61-3507-a994-744d69b4c2a3",
                        "source_sense_id": "4d0c44d0-85e3-351a-9bcd-f45949943cf4",
                        "source_sense_description": "remains of a meteor",
                        "target_lang_word": "météorite",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "météorite",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e5b85dd7-0581-3d07-a45d-8e906022266e",
                                        "entry_id": "b55cccbd-73bc-3dff-8b60-ac0f766e2e7d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Aérolithe, masse minérale, pierre tombée du ciel."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5ef93eb7-3644-4a91-b133-fa914bc7bee4",
                                                "sense_id": "e5b85dd7-0581-3d07-a45d-8e906022266e",
                                                "text": "Par contre il faut arriver à prélever un microfragment du matériau, sans abîmer ta météorite."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4fa966b2-0278-48df-a668-a6b16a7c7abb",
                                                "sense_id": "e5b85dd7-0581-3d07-a45d-8e906022266e",
                                                "text": "Un jour, elle m’apporte une pierre couleur de fer, lisse et lourde. C’est une météorite, et le contact de mes mains avec ce corps tombé du ciel il y a peut-être des millénaires me fait frissonner comme un secret."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ad843b35-c10e-47aa-8ffa-661454959e5b",
                                                "sense_id": "e5b85dd7-0581-3d07-a45d-8e906022266e",
                                                "text": "Le fer sulfuré magnètique se trouve également dans le météorite, tantôt disséminé en petits grains, tantôt enchâssé, en amas."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "60323a5a-0eb7-4901-ad39-b5fc8edfc0c0",
